          <a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" style="justify-content:flex-start" target="_blank" href="?page=print&type=donors" title="Printable top-donor report for the year"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown" style="color:var(--amber-dark)"></i> Donor report <span style="color:var(--gray-400);font-weight:400;margin-left:6px">— top givers this year</span></a>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:var(--text-xs);color:var(--gray-400);margin-top:var(--sp-3)"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-invoice-dollar"></i> Year-end <strong>giving statements</strong> (IRS Pub. 1771 wording) print from each member's row on the Members page.</p>
